# Full System Review — Rover Tracking Antenna V3.0 (Current State)

> Every file re-read. Every data path traced. Every interaction verified.

---

## 1. End-to-End Data Flow Verification

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant ROS as ROS2 /nav_sat
    participant PY as Python Bridge
    participant BS as Base Station ESP32
    participant ANT as Antenna ESP32
    participant SERVO as Servo Motor

    ROS->>PY: NavSatFix (lat, lon)
    PY->>BS: "lat:23.810,lon:90.412\n" (USB 115200)
    BS->>BS: Parse → validate → store rLat, rLon
    BS->>ANT: "lat:23.810,lon:90.412\n" (Serial2 9600, 5Hz)
    ANT->>ANT: Parse char-by-char → rov_lat, rov_lon
    ANT->>ANT: Read own GPS → ant_lat, ant_lon
    ANT->>ANT: Read compass → heading
    ANT->>ANT: bearing = haversine(ant → rov)
    ANT->>ANT: error = normalize(bearing - heading)
    ANT->>ANT: error = deadband(error) → LPF(error)
    ANT->>ANT: servo_angle = 90 + error
    ANT->>SERVO: PWM write (cur_servo_us updated)
```

### Protocol Match Verification

| Link | Sender Format | Receiver Parser | Match? |
|------|--------------|-----------------|--------|
| PY → BS | `f"lat:{lat:.7f},lon:{lon:.7f}\n"` | `readStringUntil('\n')` + indexOf parser | ✅ |
| BS → ANT | `"lat:" + String(rLat,7) + ",lon:" + String(rLon,7) + "\n"` (println) | char-by-char buffer + `parse_telemetry_line()` | ✅ |

### Baud Rate Match

| Link | TX Side | RX Side | Match? |
|------|---------|---------|--------|
| PY → BS (USB) | 115200 | 115200 | ✅ |
| BS → ANT (Serial2) | 9600 | 9600 | ✅ |

